  "summary": {
    "text": "Llama-3.1-Nemotron-Nano-8B-v1 is an 8B open-weights reasoning language model from NVIDIA, derived from Meta's Llama-3.1-8B-Instruct and released at GTC 2025 as the Nano size of the Llama Nemotron family, also offered as a hosted API. Reasoning can be switched on or off through the system prompt, and NVIDIA positions it for PCs and edge devices.",
