  "notes": "Released at GTC 2025 together with Llama-3.3-Nemotron-Super-49B-v1. On 2025-01-06 NVIDIA had announced Nano, Super and Ultra sizes of the Llama Nemotron family without naming models or describing reasoning; that tier announcement is not treated as the announced date of this model. NVIDIA describes the model as a derivative of Meta Llama-3.1-8B-Instruct (cross-organisation relation, not stored here). Hosted API: the build.nvidia.com page marks the endpoint deprecated on 08/25/2026 and the id is no longer in NVIDIA's public model list (integrate.api.nvidia.com/v1/models) on 2026-10-02; this concerns the hosted endpoint only, so the lifecycle follows the open weights, which remain downloadable. Hugging Face metadata shows the repository was created on 2025-03-16.",
